        "payload": "tree 2cc00bc3dfb61747e35e49203265861a075fe1f0\nparent c3a0710a5c06c984799c12ba800b6790703c1263\nauthor Alex Frei <40503456+hm21@users.noreply.github.com> 1780053844 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780053844 +0200\n\nfix(video-editor): split functionality with robust state management (#4809)\n\n* feat(video-editor): implement split functionality with error handling\n\n- Added state management for split operations in ClipEditorBloc, including isSplitting and lastSplitFailure.\n- Introduced localized error messages for split failures in multiple languages.\n- Updated UI components to reflect the new split state and prevent multiple split actions during an ongoing operation.\n- Enhanced video editor service to handle split rendering and added error handling for platform exceptions.\n- Implemented a snackbar notification for split failure events at the scaffold level.\n\n* test(video-player): add tests for setClips error handling\n\n* fix(video-editor): roll back failed clip splits\n\n* style(video-player): satisfy package formatter\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Liz Sweigart <127434495+NotThatKindOfDrLiz@users.noreply.github.com>",
